{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_017WPo4DFzYiukz3fzx98yYK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze the project context carefully to determine what tasks to propose.\n\n## Project Summary\n\nThis is a Go reimplementation of GNU coreutils/moreutils utilities, verified via differential testing. The pipeline is: extract specs from C source → specify (SRD + use cases) → synthesize (AI code generation) → verify (differential testing).\n\n## Current State\n\nLooking at the `requirement_states` field, I can see which SRDs have requirements in \"ready\" state:\n\n1. **srd004-ts** - All requirements ready (R1.1-R10.3) - Release 15.0\n2. **srd102-tsort** - All requirements ready (R1.1-R2.3) - Release 12.1\n\n\n3. **srd103-pathchk** - All requirements ready (R1.1-R2.3) - Release 12.1\n4. **srd104-test** - All requirements ready (R1.1-R4.2) - Release 12.1\n5. **srd105-stty** - All requirements ready (R1.1-R7.3) - Release 15.0\n6. **srd106-df** - All requirements ready (R1.1-R4.3) - Release 13.0\n7. **srd107-dir** - All requirements ready (R1.1-R3.2) - Release 12.1\n8. **srd108-vdir** - All requirements ready (R1.1-R2.4) - Release 13.0\n9. **srd109-dircolors** - All requirements ready (R1.1-R3.5) - Release 13.0\n10. **srd110-pr** - All requirements ready (R1.1-R5.2) - Release 15.0\n11. **srd111-ptx** - All requirements ready (R1.1-R5.2) - Release 15.0\n12. **srd112-chronic** - All requirements ready (R1.1-R2.3) - Release 14.0\n13. **srd113-pee** - All requirements ready (R1.1-R2.2) - Release 14.0\n14. **srd114-vidir** - All requirements ready (R1.1-R2.2) - Release 14.0\n\nNow I'm checking the code status to identify what hasn't been started yet, comparing it against the roadmap releases. Looking through the items marked as not started, I see several use cases across different releases that need implementation, starting with format and testutils in Release 00.0, then cat in 01.1, nproc in 03.1, 